==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Barboach|70}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion; both cards have the Mud-Slap attack.
*{{m|Mud-Slap}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Barboach}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

